  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Hewlett Extractive Industry Womens Rights Accountability Initiative(from ZAMB03)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project seeks to contribute to women&apos;s consciousness and women&apos;s  access to  resources in the extractives sector. In attaining this, the project will challenge negative social norms, values and practices as well as influence formal institutions around legislation and practices.  Capacities of Women&apos;s Rights organisations and other civil society organisations in the sector to support women&apos;s rights and gender justice will be enhanced while there will be facilitation for citizens to be able to participate in the development of policies, legislation and implementation mechanisms related to the Extractive Industries (EI) sector.</narrative>
  </description>
